 en from Aizawl.\nThe Moon is 14° up in the WSW · dusk.\nTimes against th
 e real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: https:/
 /occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Aizawl
